This covers files wasp added that have no upstream dwl equivalent: this
file, README.md, NOTES.md, luaconfig.c, luaconfig.h, examples/config.lua,
scripts/*, packaging/*, wasp.desktop, and assets/* (logo/branding). It does not cover
dwl.c, config.def.h, config.mk, Makefile, client.h, util.c, util.h, dwl.1,
or protocols/* -- those are modifications of dwl's own GPLv3-licensed
files and remain under LICENSE (GPLv3) as derivative works, same as any
fork of GPL code. See README.md's Credit section for the short version.
